    "name": "Bat Bots",
    "steam_appid": 3099010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bat Bots is a retro shooter that brings the feel of 80s arcades right to your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stun the Bats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun the latest prototypes of robotic bats that have escaped into the gloomy forest surrounding your secret lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/c7741a621026cb41bdf6a7f7875c6879.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/c7741a621026cb41bdf6a7f7875c6879.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/c7741a621026cb41bdf6a7f7875c6879.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of crosshair designs and colors. Enter your initials to make your mark on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/95939b014cf3b635b5c228d7fd7aa5e4.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/95939b014cf3b635b5c228d7fd7aa5e4.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/95939b014cf3b635b5c228d7fd7aa5e4.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stun with Friends and Family</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Local Multiplayer Requires At Least One Controller. Multiplayer is NOT supported with ONLY a Mouse &amp; Keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends and family as you compete to get the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0204266a12e5dc367f74b53c35621425.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0204266a12e5dc367f74b53c35621425.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0204266a12e5dc367f74b53c35621425.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or work together to defend your top-secret lab before the Bat Bots escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/2e6ab9cb86cdb8aed2a6710c46cafcf4.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/2e6ab9cb86cdb8aed2a6710c46cafcf4.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/2e6ab9cb86cdb8aed2a6710c46cafcf4.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Up with Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your gameplay by shooting the Power Cores dropped by Mod Bats. Once stunned, these cores grant a limited-time modifier that can turn the tide of the game and offer unique advantages in any game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0915e68c0fcaea5233524980be20d9de.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0915e68c0fcaea5233524980be20d9de.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0915e68c0fcaea5233524980be20d9de.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bat Bots is a retro shooter that brings the feel of 80s arcades right to your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stun the Bats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun the latest prototypes of robotic bats that have escaped into the gloomy forest surrounding your secret lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/c7741a621026cb41bdf6a7f7875c6879.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/c7741a621026cb41bdf6a7f7875c6879.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/c7741a621026cb41bdf6a7f7875c6879.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of crosshair designs and colors. Enter your initials to make your mark on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/95939b014cf3b635b5c228d7fd7aa5e4.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/95939b014cf3b635b5c228d7fd7aa5e4.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/95939b014cf3b635b5c228d7fd7aa5e4.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stun with Friends and Family</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Local Multiplayer Requires At Least One Controller. Multiplayer is NOT supported with ONLY a Mouse &amp; Keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends and family as you compete to get the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0204266a12e5dc367f74b53c35621425.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0204266a12e5dc367f74b53c35621425.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0204266a12e5dc367f74b53c35621425.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or work together to defend your top-secret lab before the Bat Bots escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/2e6ab9cb86cdb8aed2a6710c46cafcf4.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/2e6ab9cb86cdb8aed2a6710c46cafcf4.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/2e6ab9cb86cdb8aed2a6710c46cafcf4.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Up with Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your gameplay by shooting the Power Cores dropped by Mod Bats. Once stunned, these cores grant a limited-time modifier that can turn the tide of the game and offer unique advantages in any game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0915e68c0fcaea5233524980be20d9de.poster.avif?t=1732511196\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0915e68c0fcaea5233524980be20d9de.webm?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099010/extras/0915e68c0fcaea5233524980be20d9de.mp4?t=1732511196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Enjoy a modern take on timeless arcade action with Bat Bots, a nostalgic shooter inspired by the classics. Take down waves of robotic bats using precise aim and quick reflexes. Engage in solo play, challenge your friends and family, or work together to defend against the oncoming waves.",
